# Run outputs. `results/` is regenerated by `run.py run` + `run.py report` and can be large:
# `-lv 5` is required to get per-layer GPU offload out of llama-server (see config.yaml), and
# that costs ~20 MB of log per model. The archived Ollama-era harness under
# results/archive_ollama_sql/ is deliberately NOT ignored, so the old SQL question set, stub
# schema and Ollama client stay in version control as history.
results/*
!results/archive_ollama_sql/

__pycache__/
